01:01:17.640 --> 01:01:22.960
Until then, let's remember
the true hero of Season 2:

01:01:22.960 --> 01:01:26.480
Roach, gone but never forgotten.

01:01:26.480 --> 01:01:30.520
♪

01:01:30.520 --> 01:01:33.600
Enjoy your last walk
across the meadow

01:01:33.600 --> 01:01:35.320
and through the mist.

01:01:35.320 --> 01:01:37.000
♪

01:01:37.000 --> 01:01:41.040
Be not afraid of her,

01:01:41.040 --> 01:01:42.840
